stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> NONE: created

    NONE --> INCOMPLETE: send ARP request
    INCOMPLETE --> REACHABLE: ARP reply received
    INCOMPLETE --> FAILED: timeout (3 tries)

    REACHABLE --> STALE: not used recently<br/>(reachable_time elapsed)
    STALE --> DELAY: skb queued, probe<br/>via DELAY first
    DELAY --> REACHABLE: confirmation
    DELAY --> PROBE: still no confirmation
    PROBE --> REACHABLE: ARP reply
    PROBE --> FAILED: timeout

    FAILED --> NONE: gc / app retry
    REACHABLE --> [*]: gc'd if old enough

    note right of REACHABLE
        States from
        include/net/neighbour.h
    end note
